<%- include('../partials/header') %><div class="admin-wrap"><div class="admin-panel"><p class="eyebrow">DATA PROTECTION</p><h1>Backups & recovery</h1><div class="admin-nav"><a href="/admin">← Dashboard</a></div><p>Backups include the SQLite database, uploaded images and private documents. Store a downloaded copy away from the web server.</p><form method="post" action="/admin/backups"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><button class="admin-button red" type="submit">Create backup now</button></form><% if(items.length){ %><table class="admin-table" style="margin-top:24px"><thead><tr><th>Backup archive</th><th>Size</th><th>Download</th></tr></thead><tbody><% items.forEach(x=>{ %><tr><td><%= x.name %></td><td><%= (x.size/1024/1024).toFixed(2) %> MB</td><td><a class="text-link" href="/admin/backups/<%= encodeURIComponent(x.name) %>">Download</a></td></tr><% }) %></tbody></table><% }else{ %><p class="small-muted">No backups have been created yet.</p><% } %><p class="small-muted">A backup is only useful if it can be restored. Test restoration on a separate copy before relying on it.</p></div></div><%- include('../partials/footer') %>
